   "en": "Meet Koizumi, the new speechless transfer student. She loves ramen. A LOT. She will go to all lengths to eat some ramen and there is no such thing as too much. Oosawa Yuu follows closely behind, trying to get close to Koizumi at every opportunity, despite her disapproval.",
